{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048530/extras/16b5956a45cce1a2785fdbc2e3163e44.avif?t=1758482773\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through bullet-hell with Astro, the fearless space cat, and her robot buddy AL!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Power up with Catnip Mode, stack wild weapons, and claw your way through enemies in this action-packed shoot-\u2019em-up with serious <i>cat-titude</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048530/extras/c18fb1671c2d3e23602a2527acd7d06c.avif?t=1758482773\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo of\u00a0<strong>Astro Burn</strong>, you play as <i>Astro</i> \u2014 a fearless feline space pilot with her robot companion - AL, returning from a deep-space mission, only to find Earth in ruins, encircled by towering mysterious machines\u2026 and not a single human in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0What\u2019s in the Demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>1 Arcade Level</strong> \u2014 classic shoot-\u2019em-up action, fur-real!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e <strong>1 End-of-Level Boss</strong> \u2014 bigger, badder, and claw-challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>1 Co-op Level</strong> \u2014 because two cats fight better than one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8a <strong>Power-Ups Galore</strong> \u2014 Health, Ammo, Shields, plus the time-bending <strong>Catnip Mode</strong> (bullet-time in space, meow-yeah!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Fur-midable Weapons</strong> \u2014 spreader blasters, grenades, and more to paw-er up your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Stack-\u2019Em-Up Weapon System</strong> \u2014 keep collecting, keep clawing through enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf93 <strong>Tutorial (optional)</strong> \u2014 purr-fect for new space cadets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story Mode (optional)</strong> \u2014 unravel the tail behind Earth\u2019s mysterious fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31\u2728 This is bullet-hell with serious <i>cat-titude</i>. Do you have the nine lives it takes to save Earth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048530/extras/b159675897bda83c64ae58e6319d4397.avif?t=1758482773\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw your way to the top of the local leaderboard in this purr-fectly retro space shooter \u2014 will you be the ultimate space cat with the high score to match?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048530/extras/d59e96dc84e7879c4eda13f1a99393ea.poster.avif?t=1758482773\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048530/extras/d59e96dc84e7879c4eda13f1a99393ea.webm?t=1758482773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048530/extras/d59e96dc84e7879c4eda13f1a99393ea.mp4?t=1758482773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.